# Plan match (locked 12 Sep 2026)

Founder ka rule: **jo features backend kisi plan ko deta hai, awam ko frontend UI/UX mein wahi milenge — kam nahi, zyada nahi, fake nahi.**

| Plan | UI/UX |
|---|---|
| **Basic** | Basic ke features ka UI — baaki locked preview / upgrade CTA |
| **Pro** | Pro ke backend features ka poora UI |
| **Business** | Business ke complete package features ka UI |
| **Business Pro** | Jo backend offer karta hai, sab ka UI |

## Kaam ka tareeqa

1. Card = `plans.ts` (no-touch). Backend = Supabase SQL + Rust `:3200` PRIMARY + Bun fallback.
2. Har card line ko repo se match karo. Missing mile to **real wire** se fix karo — mock / fake / empty lie banned.
3. Feature gate sirf `plan-surface.ts` se. Naya hard-coded plan string UI mein nahi.
4. Backend mein hai lekin UI nahi → UI banao. UI hai lekin backend nahi → honest "not wired", fake mat do.
5. Card vs blueprint SQL conflict ho (jaise 48h delete) → **founder decide kare**, agent khud na badle.

## Ab tak ke audit fixes (12 Sep 2026)

- Undo send 20s → **30s** (Basic card match)
- Calendar personal users 401 → **fixed** (`orgFilter` by `created_by`)
- Business one-click export → **`GET /api/org/export`** + Compliance button
